### `.gitignore` (Prevents `.exe` and Save-File Merge Conflicts)
```gitignore
# Compiled binaries and object files
*.exe
*.o
*.out
build/

# IDE folders
.vscode/
.vs/
*.user

# Ignore local test saves/scores (keep empty data/ folder via .gitkeep)
data/*.dat
data/*.csv
data/*.txt

# Keep report drafts out of code repo
*.docx
*.pdf